OL,3,ARelief, tears and sadness: Married at
OL,4,AFirst Sight UK cast react to show being
OL,5,Aaxed
OL,6,
OL,7,FCommenting on the review, she said:
OL,8,F"Suggesting the programme could
OL,9,Freasonably continue with the
OL,10,Fimplementation of a 'safe word', 'panic
OL,11,Fbutton' or 'lockable bathroom with an
OL,12,Fextra bolt inside' is absolute insanity
OL,13,Fto me."
